<title>SWITZERLAND: Unilabs shares open at 700 Swiss francs.</title>
<headline>Unilabs shares open at 700 Swiss francs.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Unilabs SA began trading on the Swiss exchange at 700 Swiss francs, above the issue price fixed at 675 francs.</p>
<p>Unilabs is a Geneva-based clinical laboratory active in Switzerland and Europe.</p>
<p>Shares had been quoted in a broad range between 700 and 750 francs in pre-bourse trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
